        <headline>Marine Weather Statement issued September 25 at 5:47AM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK</headline>
        <description>Patchy dense fog may occasionally reduce visibilities to a
quarter of a mile or less until conditions gradually improve by
late morning.

Mariners should exercise additional caution and be prepared for
possible rapid reductions in visibility.
</description>
